The issue was that `Dependant.cache_key` conditionally included OAuth2 scopes only if `_uses_scopes` was `True`. This led to cache key collisions when the same dependency was used in different contexts (one with inherited scopes and one without), causing scopes to be missing from the OpenAPI documentation in some scenarios. The fix is to always include `oauth_scopes` in the `cache_key`.

```python
    @property
    def cache_key(self) -> DependencyCacheKey:
        return DependencyCacheKey(
            self.call,
            self.name,
            self.use_cache,
            self.scope,
            self.oauth_scopes,
        )
